  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with singleprofile settings, replacing the previous pca_n2000 encoder. Validation accuracy (0.520) and F1 (0.498) improved compared to the baseline (0.485 and 0.464), suggesting the scvi_n200 encoder may offer better performance. However, the impact of other design choices, such as aggregation or fusion strategies, remains uncertain without further comparative experiments."
}

